<title>USA: U.S. Treasury balances at Fed fell on April 3.</title>
<headline>U.S. Treasury balances at Fed fell on April 3.</headline>
<dateline>WASHINGTON 1997-04-04</dateline>
<text>
<p>U.S. Treasury balances at Federal Reserve based on Treasury Department's latest budget statement.</p>
<p>			  (BILLIONS OF DLRS)</p>
<p>				 April 3		April 2</p>
<p>Fed acct			 3.746		  5.092</p>
<p>Tax/loan note acct	  19.366		 18.742</p>
<p>Cash balance		  23.112		 23.834</p>
<p>---</p>
<p>Total public debt,</p>
<p> subject to limit	5,298.162	     5,290.292</p>
<p>---</p>
<p>Treasury said individual income tax refunds valued at $11 million were issued and $210 million of corporate refunds were issued.</p>
